Assuming that the printer has an IP address defined that is known by the print
server, try the following:

lp0|0|lp|5si/mx:\
        :lf=/usr/adm/lp0err:\
        :sd=/usr/spool/lpd0:\
        :rm=printername.host.domain:\
        :rp=text:\
        :lp=:\
        :mx#0:


